# Allowlist: only the web deck, its builders, fonts and the slide source are tracked.
# Everything else in this folder (PPTX decks, rendered videos, frame dumps, previews) is scratch.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!AGENTS.md
!.github/
!.github/**
!prague-deck/
!prague-deck/**
!make_deck_page.py
!make_slides.py
!test_deck.mjs
!mock_slide2.py
!makeover/
!makeover/makeover.py
!makeover/patch_figures.py
!makeover/test_makeover.mjs
!figures/
!figures/**
!requirements.txt
!build.sh
!fonts/
!fonts/**
!source/
!source/**
# scratch inside tracked dirs
.venv/
figures/**/__pycache__/
prague-deck/*.zip
node_modules/
__pycache__/
